Prevedi cosa stampa:

```c
printf("%d\n", 17 / 5);
printf("%d\n", 17 % 5);
printf("%d\n", 17 / 5 * 5 + 17 % 5);
printf("%d\n", 1 + 10 / 4 * 2);
printf("%f\n", 10 / 4.0);
